    "created_at": "2026-10-08T10:59:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-10-08T10:59:23Z",
    "body": "> In [this step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#updating-the-image-data:select-an-image-source) the selected pixel density is returned from the \"select an image source\" algorithm, but it's never used anywhere in \"update the image data\". It seems like it should be added to the [new image request](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#updating-the-image-data:image-request-2) that is created in step 16.\n\nThis is fixed by #13046.\n\n> Similarly, the `img` element's last selected source isn't updated anywhere in the \"update the image data\" algorithm, which seems strange.\n\nThis part is covered by #5060. ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
